(b) Honest fast path (incumbent halted at t0; window at +120 s, adoption at +180 s; then pump 2x/120s from +300 s) onto thinner, deeper and lambda < lambda_min candidates.  Window floor: locked SOL at P_ema >= 25 SOL (M4R: at min(P_ema, P_cand) at the proposal, the same here; v0.4.1: real SOL >= 25 and lambda >= 50 %).  M4R: L_ema / √(X·Y) at the switch -> at the gate (8 integrations later); the wide seconds inside the warm-up gate decide nothing.  #99: M4R also needs the capped position to fit the candidate's opening caps as an open right after the adoption (X0 <= min(L_slow, D)/sqrt(P)): a candidate whose locked depth D is below the incumbent's L_slow does not carry it: no window, the position frozen on the halted pool.

