(d1) Held drain of every unlocked LP (the lowest L any instruction or observation can read is D) on pools of the same locked depth D at lambda 50 / 25 / 10 %; capped position opened on the pool, and RA's capped position carried by the fast path onto a candidate whose unlocked LP is then drained.  #99: a candidate with D = 25 % of pool_d (pool_fast_min_bps) no longer carries it (an open on it right after the adoption is sized on min(L_slow, D) = D, an eighth of the incumbent's depth): refused, the position stays frozen on the halted pool (1.00x; S3 at fair value at its deadline); the thinnest candidate that carries it has D = the incumbent's whole depth (twice pool_d at lambda 50 %).

